    <string name="command_examples_body">Say %1$s, followed by one of these commands. They apply to text already in the field or to text dictated immediately after the command:

• %1$s, summarize this in two sentences
• %1$s, improve the flow
• %1$s, translate to Italian
• %1$s, make this more formal
• %1$s, turn this into a list

You can combine commands: %1$s, translate to Italian and turn it into a list. They are applied in that order.</string>
